  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall project objective is related to SP2 - Increase and improve provision of goods and services from agriculture, forestry and fisheries in a sustainable manner. 
More specifically, FAO will contribute to 1. Improve data and Information collation and dissemination for a.o. Fisheries traceability (GRSF) 2. Develop regional capacity to collate and harmonize fisheries data in regional databases (e.g. Tuna Atlas), 3. Capacity building in the management of remote sensing data (Aquaculture Monitor)</narrative>
  </description>
